WEBVTT

00:04:26.246 --> 00:04:30.663
(Video) (Helicopter hovering)

00:04:33.621 --> 00:04:37.913
(Sirens wailing)

00:04:38.288 --> 00:04:40.538
(Fire blazing)

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:51.579
Seven people died
and hundreds lost their home.

00:04:52.204 --> 00:04:55.579
The city mourned the human tragedy

00:04:55.579 --> 00:04:58.204
and the destruction
of its cultural landmark.

00:04:58.913 --> 00:05:02.204
For me, there was another layer of grief.